msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "Mise à l’échelle"

#, kde-format
msgid "On-Screen Display"
msgstr "Affichage à l’écran"

#, kde-format
msgid "Added by you."
msgstr "Ajoutée par vous."

#, kde-format
msgid "Add from Window"
msgstr "Ajouter depuis une fenêtre"

#, kde-format
msgid "The window could not be identified: %1"
msgstr "Impossible d’identifier la fenêtre : %1"

#, kde-format
msgid "The window does not identify its application."
msgstr "La fenêtre n’indique pas son application."

#, kde-format
msgid "Top left"
msgstr "En haut à gauche"

#, kde-format
msgid "Top right"
msgstr "En haut à droite"

#, kde-format
msgid "Bottom left"
msgstr "En bas à gauche"

#, kde-format
msgid "Bottom right"
msgstr "En bas à droite"

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Each display uses its own corner. Choosing a corner in use moves the other "
"display to the next free one."
msgstr ""
"Chaque affichage utilise son propre coin. Choisir un coin déjà occupé "
"déplace l’autre affichage vers le suivant libre."

#, kde-format
msgctxt "Suffix: the unit symbol for seconds"
msgid " s"
msgstr " s"

#, kde-format
msgid "Show startup information for:"
msgstr "Afficher les informations de démarrage pendant :"

#, kde-format
msgid "Startup information position:"
msgstr "Position des informations de démarrage :"

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Shows the average frame rate and the slowest frames while a game is running."
msgstr ""
"Affiche la fréquence d’images moyenne et les images les plus lentes pendant "
"qu’un jeu tourne."

#, kde-format
msgid "Frame rate position:"
msgstr "Position de la fréquence d’images :"

#, kde-format
msgid "Developer information position:"
msgstr "Position des informations de développement :"

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Normally the displays appear only over applications this effect acts on. "
"This also shows them over any other window that fills its screen, such as a "
"browser playing a video, to find out why a game is not recognized."
msgstr ""
"Normalement, les affichages n’apparaissent qu’au-dessus des applications sur "
"lesquelles agit cet effet. Ceci les affiche aussi au-dessus de toute autre "
"fenêtre qui remplit son écran, comme un navigateur lisant une vidéo, pour "
"découvrir pourquoi un jeu n’est pas reconnu."

#, kde-format
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "inconnu"

#, kde-format
msgid "%1 (0x%2)"
msgstr "%1 (0x%2)"

#, kde-format
msgid "none"
msgstr "aucun"

#, kde-format
msgid "Program:"
msgstr "Programme :"

#, kde-format
msgid "Window class:"
msgstr "Classe de fenêtre :"

#, kde-format
msgid "Window instance:"
msgstr "Instance de fenêtre :"

#, kde-format
msgid "Any"
msgstr "Quelconque"

#, kde-format
msgid "Exact match"
msgstr "Correspondance exacte"

#, kde-format
msgid "Substring match"
msgstr "Correspondance partielle"

#, kde-format
msgid "Regular expression"
msgstr "Expression rationnelle"

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The program's full path. As a regular expression, .*/program matches that "
"program in any folder."
msgstr ""
"Le chemin complet du programme. En expression rationnelle, .*/programme "
"correspond à ce programme dans n’importe quel dossier."

#, kde-format
msgid "No open window matches."
msgstr "Aucune fenêtre ouverte ne correspond."

#, kde-format
msgctxt "Between window titles"
msgid ", "
msgstr ", "

#, kde-format
msgid "Matches the open window “%2”."
msgid_plural "Matches %1 open windows: %2"
msgstr[0] "Correspond à la fenêtre ouverte « %2 »."
msgstr[1] "Correspond à %1 fenêtres ouvertes : %2"

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"It states neither a program nor a window class or instance, so it would "
"match every window."
msgstr ""
"Elle n’indique ni programme, ni classe ou instance de fenêtre, et "
"correspondrait donc à toutes les fenêtres."

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Its Wayland fullscreen method is sent before the window exists, so it needs "
"a program and no window class or instance."
msgstr ""
"Sa méthode pour le plein écran Wayland est envoyée avant que la fenêtre "
"n’existe, elle nécessite donc un programme et aucune classe ou instance de "
"fenêtre."

#, kde-format
msgid "Wayland fullscreen:"
msgstr "Plein écran Wayland :"

#, kde-format
msgid "Wayland borderless:"
msgstr "Wayland sans bordure :"

#, kde-format
msgid "Wayland windowed:"
msgstr "Wayland fenêtré :"

#, kde-format
msgid "X11 fullscreen:"
msgstr "Plein écran X11 :"

#, kde-format
msgid "X11 borderless:"
msgstr "X11 sans bordure :"

#, kde-format
msgid "X11 windowed:"
msgstr "X11 fenêtré :"

#, kde-format
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automatique"

#, kde-format
msgctxt "A resolution request method"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Désactivée"

#, kde-format
msgid "Smaller screen mode"
msgstr "Mode d’écran plus petit"

#, kde-format
msgid "Smaller screen scale"
msgstr "Échelle d’écran plus petite"

#, kde-format
msgid "Smaller mode and scale"
msgstr "Mode et échelle plus petits"

#, kde-format
msgid "Smaller X11 buffer"
msgstr "Tampon X11 plus petit"

#, kde-format
msgid "Use the measured method, or that of “All applications”"
msgstr ""
"Utiliser la méthode mesurée, sinon celle de « Toutes les applications »"

#, kde-format
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Debug"

#, kde-format
msgid "Release"
msgstr "Release"

#, kde-format
msgid "OpenGL ES"
msgstr "OpenGL ES"

#, kde-format
msgid "OpenGL"
msgstr "OpenGL"

#, kde-format
msgctxt "%1 is the pattern, %2 what is wrong with it"
msgid "“%1” is not a valid regular expression: %2"
msgstr "« %1 » n’est pas une expression rationnelle valable : %2"

#, kde-format
msgctxt "%1 is the pattern"
msgid "“%1” matches everything."
msgstr "« %1 » correspond à tout."

#, kde-format
msgid "Enable the X11 proxy at login"
msgstr "Activer le proxy X11 à la connexion"

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Tell recognized X11 games the smaller screen before they create a window. "
"Switching this takes effect at the next login."
msgstr ""
"Indiquer l’écran plus petit aux jeux X11 reconnus avant qu’ils ne créent une "
"fenêtre. Le changement prend effet à la prochaine connexion."

#, kde-format
msgid "Log out required: apply, then log out and back in to use the X11 proxy."
msgstr ""
"Déconnexion nécessaire : appliquez, puis déconnectez-vous et reconnectez-"
"vous pour utiliser le proxy X11."

#, kde-format
msgid "X11 routing is disabled for the next login."
msgstr "Le routage X11 est désactivé pour la prochaine connexion."

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Log out required: apply, then log out and back in to stop using the X11 "
"proxy. X11 programs already running keep using it until then."
msgstr ""
"Déconnexion nécessaire : appliquez, puis déconnectez-vous et reconnectez-"
"vous pour ne plus utiliser le proxy X11. Les programmes X11 déjà lancés "
"continuent de l’utiliser jusque-là."

#, kde-format
msgid "This session was configured to use the X11 proxy."
msgstr "Cette session a été configurée pour utiliser le proxy X11."

#, kde-format
msgid "This session uses Xwayland directly, without the proxy."
msgstr "Cette session utilise Xwayland directement, sans le proxy."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "upscaling was switched off."
msgstr "la mise à l’échelle a été désactivée."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid ""
"the application is not in the list, and “All applications” is switched off."
msgstr ""
"l’application n’est pas dans la liste et « Toutes les applications » est "
"désactivé."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the screen is at or below the resolution limit."
msgstr "l’écran est à la limite de résolution ou en dessous."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid ""
"a graphics resource could not be created; apply the settings to try again."
msgstr ""
"une ressource graphique n’a pas pu être créée ; appliquez les paramètres "
"pour réessayer."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the screen is locked."
msgstr "l’écran est verrouillé."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "another fullscreen effect is active."
msgstr "un autre effet plein écran est actif."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window has not supplied a buffer yet."
msgstr "la fenêtre n’a pas encore fourni de tampon."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the supplied buffer is empty."
msgstr "le tampon fourni est vide."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the supplied buffer is not smaller than the destination."
msgstr "le tampon fourni n’est pas plus petit que la destination."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the supplied buffer is less than half the destination size."
msgstr "le tampon fourni fait moins de la moitié de la taille de destination."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the supplied buffer has a different aspect ratio than the destination."
msgstr "le tampon fourni n’a pas le même rapport d’aspect que la destination."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid ""
"the supplied buffer is larger than the destination, so no whole-number "
"multiple of it fits."
msgstr ""
"le tampon fourni est plus grand que la destination, aucun multiple entier ne "
"tient donc."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid ""
"the whole-number factor that fits is not two, the only one FSR 1 enlarges by."
msgstr ""
"le facteur entier qui tient n’est pas deux, le seul par lequel FSR 1 "
"agrandit."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the supplied buffer is rotated or flipped."
msgstr "le tampon fourni est pivoté ou retourné."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "only part of the supplied buffer is displayed."
msgstr "seule une partie du tampon fourni est affichée."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the supplied buffer is not fully opaque."
msgstr "le tampon fourni n’est pas entièrement opaque."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the supplied buffer format cannot be read by the scaler."
msgstr "le format du tampon fourni ne peut pas être lu par le redimensionneur."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "this frame paints the window or the screen with a transformation."
msgstr "cette image dessine la fenêtre ou l’écran avec une transformation."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "this frame paints the window with reduced opacity."
msgstr "cette image dessine la fenêtre avec une opacité réduite."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "this frame paints the window with adjusted brightness or saturation."
msgstr ""
"cette image dessine la fenêtre avec une luminosité ou une saturation ajustée."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "this frame paints at a different scale than the output."
msgstr "cette image dessine à une autre échelle que la sortie."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid ""
"this frame's render target has an orientation the scaler does not handle."
msgstr ""
"la cible de rendu de cette image a une orientation que le redimensionneur ne "
"gère pas."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "more than one fullscreen window is eligible on this output."
msgstr "plus d’une fenêtre plein écran est éligible sur cette sortie."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "this output's color handling is not supported."
msgstr "la gestion des couleurs de cette sortie n’est pas prise en charge."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "there is no window to scale."
msgstr "il n’y a aucune fenêtre à mettre à l’échelle."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid ""
"the window is not fullscreen or a selected borderless window covering its "
"output."
msgstr ""
"la fenêtre n’est ni en plein écran, ni une fenêtre sans bordure sélectionnée "
"couvrant sa sortie."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window is closing."
msgstr "la fenêtre se ferme."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window is minimized."
msgstr "la fenêtre est réduite."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window is on another virtual desktop."
msgstr "la fenêtre est sur un autre bureau virtuel."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window is on another activity."
msgstr "la fenêtre est dans une autre activité."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "another window on its output is active."
msgstr "une autre fenêtre de sa sortie est active."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window is translucent."
msgstr "la fenêtre est translucide."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window is not on an output."
msgstr "la fenêtre n’est sur aucune sortie."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window has no surface to capture."
msgstr "la fenêtre n’a aucune surface à capturer."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the output is rotated or flipped."
msgstr "la sortie est pivotée ou retournée."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window does not exactly cover its output."
msgstr "la fenêtre ne couvre pas exactement sa sortie."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window is being transformed."
msgstr "la fenêtre est en cours de transformation."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window's surface has child surfaces."
msgstr "la surface de la fenêtre a des surfaces enfants."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window's surface is being transformed."
msgstr "la surface de la fenêtre est en cours de transformation."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window's surface is offset inside the window."
msgstr "la surface de la fenêtre est décalée dans la fenêtre."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window's surface is translucent."
msgstr "la surface de la fenêtre est translucide."

#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"A reason, after “Inactive:”, “not scaling:” or “was not scaled because”"
msgid "the window's surface is displayed at a different size than the window."
msgstr ""
"la surface de la fenêtre est affichée à une autre taille que la fenêtre."

